<td class="description">
<div class="description en" dir="ltr" lang="en"><span class="language en" title="English"><b>English&#58; </b></span> The keep of <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nagoya_Castle" class="extiw" title="en:Nagoya Castle">Nagoya Castle</a> (名古屋城, <i>Nagoya-jō</i>) located in Nagoya, Aichi Prefecture, Japan. Originally built around 1525, destroyed during World War II. Reconstructed in 1959, currently under exhibition.</div></td>
</tr>

