<table style="width:100%;">


<tbody><tr>
<td style="width:40px;text-align:center;" rowspan="2">
<span typeof="mw:File"><span title="Featured picture"><img alt="Featured picture" src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/40px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="40" height="38" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/120px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="466" data-file-height="443" /></span></span><figure class="mw-halign-center" typeof="mw:File"><span title="Quality image"><img alt="Quality image" src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Quality_images_logo.svg/40px-Quality_images_logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="40" height="35" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8c/Quality_images_logo.svg/120px-Quality_images_logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="142" /></span><figcaption>Quality image</figcaption></figure>
</td>
<td>
</td>
<td style="width:30px;text-align:center;" rowspan="2">
<p><span typeof="mw:File"><span title="Wikimedia Commons"><img alt="Wikimedia Commons" src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Commons-logo.svg/40px-Commons-logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="30" height="40" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Commons-logo.svg/60px-Commons-logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="1024" data-file-height="1376" /></span></span><span typeof="mw:File"><span title="Wikipedia"><img alt="Wikipedia" src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg/40px-Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="30" height="27" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg/60px-Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="103" data-file-height="94" /></span></span>
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>This is a <b>featured picture</b> on Wikimedia Commons (<a href="/wiki/Commons:Featured_pictures" title="Commons:Featured pictures">Featured pictures</a>) and is considered one of the finest images. See its nomination <a href="/wiki/Commons:Featured_picture_candidates/Image:Nagoya_Castle.jpg" title="Commons:Featured picture candidates/Image:Nagoya Castle.jpg">here</a>.<br />This is a <b><a href="/wiki/Commons:Quality_images" title="Commons:Quality images">quality image</a></b> and is considered to meet the <a href="/wiki/Commons:Image_guidelines" title="Commons:Image guidelines">quality image guidelines</a>.<br /><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/Video-display-wide.svg/20px-Video-display-wide.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="14" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/Video-display-wide.svg/40px-Video-display-wide.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="62" data-file-height="42" /></span></span>&#160;With an <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aspect_ratio_(image)" class="extiw" title="wikipedia:Aspect ratio (image)">aspect ratio</a> of <b>8:5</b>, <b>16:10</b>, or <b>16:9</b>, this image is suitable as a <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/widescreen" class="extiw" title="wikipedia:widescreen">widescreen</a> <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wallpaper_(computing)" class="extiw" title="wikipedia:Wallpaper (computing)">computer wallpaper</a> (see <a href="/wiki/Category:Commons_featured_widescreen_desktop_backgrounds" title="Category:Commons featured widescreen desktop backgrounds">gallery</a>).<br /><hr /><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/20px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="19" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/40px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="466" data-file-height="443" /></span></span>&#160;This is a <b>featured picture</b> on the Spanish language Wikipedia (<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/es:Wikipedia:Recursos_destacados" class="extiw" title="w:es:Wikipedia:Recursos destacados">Recursos destacados</a>) and is considered one of the finest images. See its nomination <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/es:Wikipedia:Candidatos_a_recursos_destacados/Nagoya_Castle(Larger).jpg" class="extiw" title="w:es:Wikipedia:Candidatos a recursos destacados/Nagoya Castle(Larger).jpg">here</a>.<br /><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/20px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="19" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/40px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="466" data-file-height="443" /></span></span>&#160;This is a <b>featured picture</b> on the Turkish language Wikipedia (<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/tr:Vikipedi:Se%C3%A7kin_resimler" class="extiw" title="w:tr:Vikipedi:Seçkin resimler">Seçkin resimler</a>) and is considered one of the finest images. See its nomination <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/tr:Vikipedi:Se%C3%A7kin_resim_adaylar%C4%B1/Nagoya_Castle(Larger).jpg" class="extiw" title="w:tr:Vikipedi:Seçkin resim adayları/Nagoya Castle(Larger).jpg">here</a>.<br />
<hr />
<p>If you have an image of similar quality that can be published under a <a href="/wiki/Commons:Licensing" title="Commons:Licensing">suitable copyright license</a>, be sure to <a href="/wiki/Special:Upload" title="Special:Upload">upload</a> it, <a href="/wiki/Commons:Copyright_tags" title="Commons:Copyright tags">tag</a> it, and <a href="/wiki/Commons:Featured_picture_candidates" title="Commons:Featured picture candidates">nominate it</a>.<br />
</p>
</td></tr></tbody></table>
</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table>
</td></tr></tbody></table>
</div>
