<table cellspacing="8" cellpadding="0" style="width:100%; clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; background-color:var(--background-color-warning-subtle,#FAF5E6); border:2px solid var(--border-color-content-removed,#E5D4A1);color: inherit;">
<tbody><tr>
<td style="width:64px; text-align:center;"><span typeof="mw:File"><span title="Picture of week on Malay Wikipedia"><img alt="Picture of week on Malay Wikipedia" src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6b/MS_-_Star_%26_Moon_%28FA%29.png/60px-MS_-_Star_%26_Moon_%28FA%29.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="43" height="51" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/MS_-_Star_%26_Moon_%28FA%29.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x" data-file-width="71" data-file-height="85" /></span></span>
</td>
<td><div class="description ar" dir="rtl" lang="ar"><span class="language ar" title="Arabic"><b>العربية&#58; </b></span> اُختيرت هذه الصُّورة لتكون <b><a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Gambar_pilihan_mingguan" class="extiw" title="ms:Wikipedia:Gambar pilihan mingguan">صُورة الأسبوع</a></b> في <a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laman_Utama" class="extiw" title="ms:Laman Utama">ويكيبيديا الملايو</a> في الأسبوع 35 من عام 2009.</div>
<div class="description de" dir="ltr" lang="de"><span class="language de" title="German"><b>Deutsch&#58; </b></span> Dieses Bild war 2009 in der 35. Kalenderwoche das <b><a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Gambar_pilihan_mingguan" class="extiw" title="ms:Wikipedia:Gambar pilihan mingguan">Bild der Woche</a></b> in der <a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laman_Utama" class="extiw" title="ms:Laman Utama">Malaysischen Wikipedia</a></div>
<div class="description en" dir="ltr" lang="en"><span class="language en" title="English"><b>English&#58; </b></span> This image was selected as a <b><a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Gambar_pilihan_mingguan" class="extiw" title="ms:Wikipedia:Gambar pilihan mingguan">picture of the week</a></b> on the <a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laman_Utama" class="extiw" title="ms:Laman Utama">Malay Wikipedia</a> for the 35<sup>th</sup> week, 2009.</div>
<div class="description mk" dir="ltr" lang="mk"><span class="language mk" title="Macedonian"><b>Македонски&#58; </b></span> Сликава е избрана за <b><a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Gambar_pilihan_mingguan" class="extiw" title="ms:Wikipedia:Gambar pilihan mingguan">слика на неделата</a></b> на <a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laman_Utama" class="extiw" title="ms:Laman Utama">малајската Википедија</a> за XXXV недела од 2009 година.</div>
<div class="description ml" dir="ltr" lang="ml"><span class="language ml" title="Malayalam"><b>മലയാളം&#58; </b></span> <a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laman_Utama" class="extiw" title="ms:Laman Utama">മലയ് വിക്കിപീഡിയയിൽ</a> ഈ ചിത്രം <b><a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Gambar_pilihan_mingguan" class="extiw" title="ms:Wikipedia:Gambar pilihan mingguan">ഈ ആഴ്ചയിലെ ചിത്രമായി</a></b> 2009-ലെ വാരം 35-ൽ തിരഞ്ഞെടുത്തിട്ടുണ്ട്.</div>
<div class="description ms" dir="ltr" lang="ms"><span class="language ms" title="Malay"><b>Bahasa Melayu&#58; </b></span> Imej ini merupakan <b><a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Gambar_pilihan_mingguan" class="extiw" title="ms:Wikipedia:Gambar pilihan mingguan">gambar pilihan mingguan</a></b> di <a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laman_Utama" class="extiw" title="ms:Laman Utama">Wikipedia Bahasa Melayu</a> untuk minggu ke-35, 2009.</div>
<div class="description fr" dir="ltr" lang="fr"><span class="language fr" title="French"><b>Français&#160;&#58; </b></span> Cette image est sélectionnée en tant qu'<b><a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Gambar_pilihan_mingguan" class="extiw" title="ms:Wikipedia:Gambar pilihan mingguan">image de la semaine</a></b> sur la <a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laman_Utama" class="extiw" title="ms:Laman Utama">Wikipédia Malaisienne</a> pour la 35ème semaine de 2009.</div>
<div class="description hu" dir="ltr" lang="hu"><span class="language hu" title="Hungarian"><b>Magyar&#58; </b></span> Ezt a képet <b><a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Gambar_pilihan_mingguan" class="extiw" title="ms:Wikipedia:Gambar pilihan mingguan">a hét képének</a></b> választották a <a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laman_Utama" class="extiw" title="ms:Laman Utama">maláj Wikipedián</a> 2009 35. hetében.</div>
<div class="description it" dir="ltr" lang="it"><span class="language it" title="Italian"><b>Italiano&#58; </b></span> Questa immagine è stata selezionata come <b><a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Gambar_pilihan_mingguan" class="extiw" title="ms:Wikipedia:Gambar pilihan mingguan">Immagine della settimana</a></b> su <a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laman_Utama" class="extiw" title="ms:Laman Utama">Wikipedia in malese</a> per la XXXV settimana del 2009.</div>
<div class="description nl" dir="ltr" lang="nl"><span class="language nl" title="Dutch"><b>Nederlands&#58; </b></span> Deze afbeelding is gekozen als <b><a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Gambar_pilihan_mingguan" class="extiw" title="ms:Wikipedia:Gambar pilihan mingguan">afbeelding van de week</a></b> op de <a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laman_Utama" class="extiw" title="ms:Laman Utama">Maleisische Wikipedia</a> voor week 35 van 2009.</div>
<div class="description ru" dir="ltr" lang="ru"><span class="language ru" title="Russian"><b>Русский&#58; </b></span> Эта иллюстрация была выбрана <b><a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Gambar_pilihan_mingguan" class="extiw" title="ms:Wikipedia:Gambar pilihan mingguan">изображением недели</a></b> в <a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laman_Utama" class="extiw" title="ms:Laman Utama">малайском разделе «Википедии»</a> для недели номер 35 2009 года.</div>
<div class="description sv" dir="ltr" lang="sv"><span class="language sv" title="Swedish"><b>Svenska&#58; </b></span> Denna bild är utvald till <b><a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Gambar_pilihan_mingguan" class="extiw" title="ms:Wikipedia:Gambar pilihan mingguan">veckans bild</a></b> på <a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laman_Utama" class="extiw" title="ms:Laman Utama">Wikipedia på malajiska</a>, vecka 35, 2009.</div>
<div class="description uk" dir="ltr" lang="uk"><span class="language uk" title="Ukrainian"><b>Українська&#58; </b></span> Ця ілюстрація була вибрана <b><a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Gambar_pilihan_mingguan" class="extiw" title="ms:Wikipedia:Gambar pilihan mingguan">зображенням тижня</a></b> в <a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laman_Utama" class="extiw" title="ms:Laman Utama">малайському розділі «Вікіпедії»</a> для тижня номер 35, 2009 року.</div>
<div class="description vi" dir="ltr" lang="vi"><span class="language vi" title="Vietnamese"><b>Tiếng Việt&#58; </b></span> Hình này đã được chọn làm <b><a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Gambar_pilihan_mingguan" class="extiw" title="ms:Wikipedia:Gambar pilihan mingguan">hình ảnh của tuần</a></b> trên <a href="https://ms.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laman_Utama" class="extiw" title="ms:Laman Utama">Wikipedia tiếng Mã Lai</a> trong tuần thứ 35, năm 2009.</div>
</td>
<td><span typeof="mw:File"><span title="Picture of the week on the Malay Wikipedia"><img alt="Picture of the week on the Malay Wikipedia" src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Wikipedia-logo-ms.png/40px-Wikipedia-logo-ms.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="36" height="41" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Wikipedia-logo-ms.png/120px-Wikipedia-logo-ms.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="135" data-file-height="155" /></span></span>
</td></tr></tbody></table>
